<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais warrants on Cheung Kong Holdings.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais warrants on Cheung Kong Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 120 million American-style call warrants, on Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    68.50 HKD		 PREMIUM	13.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.9453 HKD		GEARING	7.25 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 05.NOV.96-19.NOV.97   PAYDATE	03.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  68.50 HKD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
